scenario.en:
Index: CREATE INDEX idx ON orders (user_id) INCLUDE (status). The table was just VACUUMed (VM all set).

Query A: SELECT user_id, status FROM orders WHERE user_id = 42;
Query B: SELECT user_id, status, shipped_at FROM orders WHERE user_id = 42;

Query A plans as 'Index Only Scan, Heap Fetches: 0'. What does Query B plan as, and why?

